<title>UK: Caisse Centrale Desjardins sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Caisse Centrale Desjardins sets 100 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banca Del Gottardo Lugano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE DESJARDINS, MONTREAL</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    28.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE    28.APR.97</p>
<p> EOS	  09.APR.97 LISTING    SWISS EXCHANGE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
